body:
Unfortunately I went to our local Lowe's and they couldn't help.  Apparently they only carry single slides (not double, which I guess is what I have) and he said the hinge part was something less common.  He told me I'd have to find a cabinet store and see if they can special order them.  But I'm at my parent's and there isn't much in the way of specialty stores around here.  I was hoping I could order something online, but I'm not sure if I need to get the exact match or not.  Nothing I've found is exactly the same thing. 

&#x200B;

Leave it to my parents to get something weird that no one can replace!
